        "line_start": 658,
        "line_end": 658
      },
      "segment_index": 4
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0544",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "十七是场景服务测算示例。",
      "heading_path": [
        "附件七　商务报价与收益分配参考模型"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0287",
        "line_start": 660,
        "line_end": 660
      },
      "segment_index": 1
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0545",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "某场景建设期合同价格为200万元，可以按照数据治理、模型开发、系统集成、部署实施和项目管理等工作包分别结算；",
      "heading_path": [
        "附件七　商务报价与收益分配参考模型"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0287",
        "line_start": 660,
        "line_end": 660
      },
      "segment_index": 2
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0546",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "进入运营期后，年度服务价格为60万元，扣除6万元经确认的直接成本后形成54万元可分配收入，再根据数据和模型持续供应、平台运营、技术运维、专业服务和客户维护等实际责任确定分配。",
      "heading_path": [
        "附件七　商务报价与收益分配参考模型"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0287",
        "line_start": 660,
        "line_end": 660
      },
      "segment_index": 3
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0547",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "十八是动态复盘。",
      "heading_path": [
        "附件七　商务报价与收益分配参考模型"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0288",
        "line_start": 662,
        "line_end": 662
      },
      "segment_index": 1
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0548",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "产品正式运营后，至少按年度复核客户获取成本、调用量、单位服务成本、服务质量、续约率、应收账款、平台毛利和合作伙伴履约情况。",
      "heading_path": [
        "附件七　商务报价与收益分配参考模型"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0288",
        "line_start": 662,
        "line_end": 662
      },
      "segment_index": 2
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0549",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "出现资源成本、客户需求、服务等级、模型或者数据版本、合作责任重大变化时，重新测算价格和分配安排，并履行协商和审批程序。",
      "heading_path": [
